    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section 7 of Land AcquisitionAct, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act,No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire thefollowing land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
